# The gangs and the patrolman, run with @spec as mobile_update would, at the entrance to Mud School (3700), with
# only area_update running. Smokegod (60) purges the room between each; Heroic (51, 30000 hit points) and Cherub
# (52), a room north in the same area, are there to hear the whistle.
# - a troll gang member picks a fight with an ogre, with something to say; an ogre with a troll, likewise; each a
#   few times, so the messages vary
# - with the patrolman in the room, neither starts anything
# - the patrolman, with no fight in the room, does nothing; with a fido and a drunk fighting Heroic, he blows his
#   whistle (heard by Cherub, next door) and goes for the higher level of a pair; once fighting, he does nothing
# - a patrolman leaves two patrolmen fighting each other to it
